---
config:
  theme: base
  look: classic
  htmlLabels: false
  fontSize: 20
  fontFamily: '-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif'
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant S as Supervisor
  participant R as Runtime
  participant W as Worker
  U->>S: Report
  S->>R: Dispatch
  par Background run
    R->>W: Start
    activate W
  and Dispatch acknowledgment
    R-->>S: Task ID
    S-->>U: Assigned
  end
  U->>S: Update
  W-->>R: Done
  deactivate W
  R-->>S: Result
  S->>U: Deliver
